NE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">？ 학생 1인당 1회에 한하여 분야별 인재인증기준 충족자에게&nbsp; 포상금&nbsp; 지급 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 13.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -13.7pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(200,000원/선착순 60명)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 13.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -13.7pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">？ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">인증기준에 따라 인재인증을 취득하였을 경우 해당 학생의 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">학적부&nbsp;및</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;성적기록부에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">표시</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">하며, 4가지 인재인증기준을 모두 충족할 경우</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">&nbsp;“kit 명품인재”로 표시</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">？</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 분야별 인재인증 기준을 충족한 학생에게는 총장 또는</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학부(과)장의 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">취업추천 및 장학혜택</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">을 우선 배려</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">？ 대학에서 진행하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">해외 어학연수, 취업캠프</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"> 등 각종 프로그램의</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;대상자 선</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">발시 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">가산점 부여</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양견명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"567\" height=\"32\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;□ kit 인재인증 승인 절차</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORD